{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Golden Bobber is a special item which is required for the ",["l","沙漠节#Willy's Fishing Quests","\"Golden Bobber\" quest"]," from ",["l","威利","Willy"]," during the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"]," on ",["l","春季","Spring"]," 17."]],["p",["It is obtained from ",["l","钓鱼#Treasure Chests","Fishing Treasure Chests"],". After activating the quest, the next treasure chest obtained that day is guaranteed to have the Golden Bobber. Multiple Golden Bobbers can be obtained in the same day as long as the player does not currently have a Golden Bobber in their inventory while fishing."]],["p",["If the Golden Bobber is not returned to Willy, it will not be removed from the player's inventory. The Golden Bobber can be gifted to any villager as a ",["l","友谊#Universal Hates","universally hated"]," gift. Oddly, even Willy hates receiving the Golden Bobber as a gift."]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Hate"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"]]]]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.6","1.6"],": Introduced."]]]]]]],"f":[["Source",[["l","钓鱼#Treasure Chests","Fishing Treasure Chests"]]]]}